Concatenation
-------------
Upstream the GCP stencils are split into ten category files. They share
the `mxgraph.gcp.<category>` namespace but each `<shapes>` element is
its own XML document, so we wrap them in a synthetic `<gcp-libraries>`
root element to make a single well-formed file. Files concatenated, in
this order:

  big_data.xml
  compute.xml
  developer_tools.xml
  extras.xml
  identity_and_security.xml
  machine_learning.xml
  management_tools.xml
  networking.xml
  product_cards.xml
  storage_databases.xml

The alternative `gcp2.xml` upstream is image-based (SVG data URIs) rather
than vector stencils, so it is not vendored.
